Z||000006||terryk||01-30-2001||09:35 PM||||I'm sure Chris is getting that too. He's put tons of work and effort into that engine but again, getting it and keep it that way is(am/are?) two different things. Grand Nationals can be dialed into the low 12's or better very, very easily, but one day "tink...clang...clunk...bang...walk". <P>At the same time, drop the the compression some and add cold boost and I'm sure the DOHC would really fly. I'd be curious to see the RPM for 400HP and the peak torque RPM.<P>It's not like any of us *need* these over powered beasts, but we sure want 'em!<P>Hey, it's all about money!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif">||||reg||1
